  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant AG5203: MEDITERRANEAN ADVOCACY AND LEGAL ADVICE CENTRES is a component of Transparency International ALAC reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;800,464. This project benefits Middle East, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Media and free flow of information, Statistical capacity building, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Public finance management (PFM).</narrative>
  </description>
